# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Integrity manifest (local build artifact; keep out of VCS so that the
# manifest cannot be regenerated by an attacker who modified core modules)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
bin/integrated_app/security/integrity_manifest.json
# 注：scripts/generate_integrity_manifest.py 曾随 9be5fef 移出版本控制，理由同
# 上（防“改代码+重算清单”投毒）；Ed25519 签名（D 线，2026-09-09）落地后，
# 信任根已迁移到签名私钥（data/.manifest_signing_key 不入库、CI Secret 注入），
# 生成脚本本身不含密钥，公开不再削弱安全；而 A-6 构建期重算清单硬依赖该脚本，
# 不入库会导致 CI portable-release 构建必失败，故恢复跟踪（GOTCHAS #93）。

